  "description": "After the failure of her first love, Serin easily and quickly falls in love with any good-looking guy. Two days before her birthday, she gets dumped by her hot boyfriend, and her search for a man like the legendary unicorn continues. Little did she know, she'd meet a real unicorn on the virtual reality blind dating app called Random Target. Is this app the golden ticket to finding her true love? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)\n\n *Note: Chapter count include 3 side story chapters.*",
